


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1">
    <title>시스템오류</title>
    <!--[if lt IE 9]><script src="/js/lib/html5shiv.js"></script><![endif]-->
    <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon.ico.png" />
    <style>
        .underConstruction div strong { font-size: 2.7em; font-weight: 700; line-height: 2.3em; color: #5e93d4; }
        .underConstruction div strong * { font: inherit; }
        .underConstruction div span { font-weight:700; }
        .underConstruction .prev { margin-top:15px; display:inline-block; color:#fff; background:#5e93d4; height:35px; line-height:35px; border-radius:.2em; padding:0 15px; }
        a {text-decoration:none; }
    </style>
    <script src="/js/lib/jquery-1.12.1.js" type="text/javascript"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript">
    $(function() {
        $("#errorPreViewBtnId").click(function(event){
            event.preventDefault();
            history.back(-1);
        });
    });
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <div style="position:relative; position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:0; bottom:0; text-align:center; background: url('/images/underconstruction_icon.png') center 30% no-repeat;">
        <div class="underConstruction" style="position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:45%; bottom:0;">
            <div>
                <strong>잘못된 접근경로 입니다.!</strong><br>
                <p style="line-height:26px;">
                <span>접근경로 확인 후 다시 시도 해주세요.</span><br>
                      동일한 문제가 지속적으로 발생할 경우<br>
                      <span>고객상담센터(1670-9595)</span>로 문의하여 주십시오<br>
                </p>
                <!-- 
                <a href="#" id="errorPreViewBtnId" class="prev">이전페이지 이동</a>
                 -->
                <a href="/" class="prev">메인으로 이동</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>